- testing layer: `end_to_end`
- target environment: `feature/sample`
- required evidence: `lawful replacement evidence for missing end-to-end surface`
- blocker taxonomy: `definition_missing`
- not_applicable_reason: `no_executable_boundary_at_this_layer`
- not_applicable_explanation: `This sample repo does not include an end-to-end runtime surface.`
- replacement_evidence: `The sample repo intentionally omits a runtime shell.`

## Real-Environment

- acceptance target: `State why protected real-environment followthrough is unavailable in this fixture.`
- testing layer: `real_environment`
- target environment: `develop`
- required evidence: `lawful replacement evidence for missing protected environment`
- blocker taxonomy: `definition_missing`
- not_applicable_reason: `protected_environment_only`
- not_applicable_explanation: `This isolated fixture does not provide a protected verification environment.`
- replacement_evidence: `The isolated fixture does not model a protected branch environment.`

## Acceptance Items

### PT-1
- id: `PT-1`
- requirement: `sample`
- evidence_level: `integration`
- status: `pending`
- artifact_ref: `pending://sample`
EOF

if "$REPO/bin/pretests-gate" --project "$REPO" --issue docs/epics/sample/story/issues/sample.md >"$TMP_DIR/stdout2" 2>"$TMP_DIR/stderr2"; then
